[8:47AM] #LekkiAjahCorridor
#TrafficUpdate

Movement from Ajah descending jubilee bridge onward journey Northwest, Chevron and Igboefon is in good shape, Likewise movement from Igboefon connecting Jakande , Chisco, Ikate to Marwa is good to go as well.

The return journey back to Ajah is a smooth ride. 

Traffic is moving as expected within the counter flow section as well , while personnel are visible doing the needful across the entire stretch.
